# Generated scenario-coverage report — a derived artifact of `make
# scenario-coverage` (scripts/gen_scenario_coverage.py). Committing it in every
# scenario PR serialized all of them on one generated file (each PR regenerates
# it -> add/add conflicts -> a rebase per PR). It's reproducible on demand and
# by the weekly cron; do NOT commit it. (Cron that wants a snapshot: `git add -f`.)
docs/reports/scenario-coverage-*.tsv
